    {
      "source": "The <code>basePackages</code> and <code>value</code> attributes in <code>@EnableElasticsearchRepositories</code> support <code>${…}</code> property placeholders which are resolved against the <code>Environment</code> as well as Ant-style package patterns such as <code>\"org.example.**\"</code>.",
      "translation": "`@EnableElasticsearchRepositories` 注解中的 `basePackages` 和 `value` 属性支持 `${…}` 形式的属性占位符，这些占位符将针对 `Environment` 进行解析，同时也支持 Ant 风格的包模式，例如 `\"org.example.**\"`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "In the preceding example, Spring is instructed to scan <code>com.acme.repositories</code> and all its sub-packages for interfaces extending <code>Repository</code> or one of its sub-interfaces.\nFor each interface found, the infrastructure registers the persistence technology-specific <code>FactoryBean</code> to create the appropriate proxies that handle invocations of the query methods.\nEach bean is registered under a bean name that is derived from the interface name, so an interface of <code>UserRepository</code> would be registered under <code>userRepository</code>.\nBean names for nested repository interfaces are prefixed with their enclosing type name.\nThe base package attribute allows wildcards so that you can define a pattern of scanned packages.",
      "translation": "在前面的示例中，Spring 被指示扫描 <code>com.acme.repositories</code> 及其所有子包，查找继承自 <code>Repository</code> 或其子接口的接口。  \n对于每个找到的接口，基础设施会注册特定持久化技术的 <code>FactoryBean</code>，以创建用于处理查询方法调用的相应代理。  \n每个 Bean 都使用基于接口名派生的 Bean 名称进行注册，因此名为 <code>UserRepository</code> 的接口将注册为 <code>userRepository</code>。  \n嵌套仓库接口的 Bean 名称会以其包含类型的名称作为前缀。  \n基础包属性支持通配符，因此您可以定义要扫描的包的匹配模式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example specifies the <code>app.scan.packages</code> property placeholder for the implicit <code>value</code> attribute in <code>@EnableElasticsearchRepositories</code>.",
      "translation": "以下示例为 `@EnableElasticsearchRepositories` 中的隐式 `value` 属性指定了 `<code>app.scan.packages</code>` 属性占位符。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the store-specific <code>@EnableElasticsearchRepositories</code> annotation on a Java configuration class to define a configuration for repository activation.\nFor an introduction to Java-based configuration of the Spring container, see <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/beans/java.html\">JavaConfig in the Spring reference documentation</a>.",
      "translation": "在 Java 配置类上使用特定于存储库的 `@EnableElasticsearchRepositories` 注解来定义存储库激活的配置。\n有关 Spring 容器基于 Java 配置的简介，请参阅<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/beans/java.html\">Spring 参考文档中的 JavaConfig</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, the infrastructure picks up every interface that extends the persistence technology-specific <code>Repository</code> sub-interface located under the configured base package and creates a bean instance for it.\nHowever, you might want more fine-grained control over which interfaces have bean instances created for them.\nTo do so, use filter elements inside the repository declaration.\nThe semantics are exactly equivalent to the elements in Spring’s component filters.\nFor details, see the <a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/beans/classpath-scanning.html\">Spring reference documentation</a> for these elements.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，基础设施会拾取所有继承自配置的基础包下特定持久化技术的<code>Repository</code>子接口的接口，并为其创建 Bean 实例。\n然而，您可能希望对哪些接口需要创建 Bean 实例拥有更细粒度的控制。\n为此，请在仓库声明中使用过滤元素。\n其语义与 Spring 组件过滤器中的元素完全等效。\n有关这些元素的详细信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/7.0/core/beans/classpath-scanning.html\">Spring 参考文档</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The preceding example includes all interfaces ending with <code>SomeRepository</code> and excludes those ending with <code>SomeOtherRepository</code> from being instantiated.",
      "translation": "前面的示例包含所有以<code>SomeRepository</code>结尾的接口，并排除那些以<code>SomeOtherRepository</code>结尾的接口不被实例化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Each Spring Data module includes a <code>repositories</code> element that lets you define a base package that Spring scans for you, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "每个 Spring Data 模块都包含一个 `<code>repositories</code>` 元素，该元素允许您定义一个基础包，Spring 将为您扫描此包，示例如下：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "You can also use the repository infrastructure outside of a Spring container — for example, in CDI environments.You still need some Spring libraries in your classpath, but, generally, you can set up repositories programmatically as well.The Spring Data modules that provide repository support ship with a persistence technology-specific <code>RepositoryFactory</code> that you can use, as follows:",
      "translation": "此外，您还可以在 Spring 容器之外使用仓库基础设施——例如在 CDI 环境中。您仍然需要在类路径中包含一些 Spring 库，但通常也可以以编程方式设置仓库。提供仓库支持的 Spring Data 模块附带了特定持久化技术的 <code>RepositoryFactory</code>，您可以按如下方式使用：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This section covers how to create instances and bean definitions for the defined repository interfaces.",
      "translation": "本节介绍如何为已定义的仓库接口创建实例和 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A sample configuration to enable Spring Data repositories resembles the following:",
      "translation": "启用 Spring Data 仓库的示例配置如下所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
